  "type": "numerical",
  "level": 2,
  "question": {
    "text": "<p>A rolling wheel of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>12</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> is on an inclined plane at position <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi></math> and connected to a mass of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>3</mn><mo>&#160;</mo><mi>kg</mi></math> through a string of fixed length and pulley as shown in figure.<br />Consider <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>R</mi></math> as friction free surface.<br />The velocity of centre of mass of the wheel when it reaches at the bottom <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>Q</mi></math> of the inclined plane <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> will be <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mi>x</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>&#160;</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">m</mi><mo>&#160;</mo><msup><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The value of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi></math>&nbsp;(rounded off to the nearest integer) is _____.</p><p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/1b30fe73-572a-46e1-9e41-da0e11a001c5-image.png\" style=\"width: 300px; height: 124px;\" /></p>",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "3",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>If we take the wheel as a ring then its moment of inertia will be,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>I</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></math>.</p><p>Using mechanical energy conservation,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>M</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mi>m</mi><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>m</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>M</mi><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mi>I</mi><msup><mi>&#969;</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>12</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>-</mo><mn>3</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>3</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mfrac><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><msup><mi>r</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mn>9</mn><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>15</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup><mo>+</mo><mn>12</mn><msup><mi>v</mi><mn>2</mn></msup></mrow><mn>2</mn></mfrac></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>&#8658;</mo><mi>v</mi><mo>=</mo><msqrt><mfrac><mn>2</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><mn>2</mn></mfrac><msqrt><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mi>g</mi><mi>h</mi></msqrt></math></p><p>Therefore,&nbsp;<math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>8</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#8771;</mo><mn>3</mn></math></p>",
